 ],
 "cues": [
  {
   "n": 1,
   "para": 0,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Chapter XXXVI.\nDREAM OF VENGEANCE"
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "para": 1,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "That evening Milady gave orders that when M. d’Artagnan came as usual,\nhe should be immediately admitted; but he did not come."
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "para": 2,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "The next day Kitty went to see the young man again, and related to him\nall that had passed on the preceding evening. D’Artagnan smiled; this\njealous anger of Milady was his revenge."
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "para": 3,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "That evening Milady was still more impatient than on the preceding\nevening. She renewed the order relative to the Gascon; but as before\nshe expected him in vain."
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "para": 4,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "The next morning, when Kitty presented herself at D’Artagnan’s, she was\nno longer joyous and alert as on the two preceding days; but on the\ncontrary sad as death."
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "para": 5,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "D’Artagnan asked the poor girl what was the matter with her; but she,\nas her only reply, drew a letter from her pocket and gave it to him."
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "para": 6,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "This letter was in Milady’s handwriting; only this time it was\naddressed to M. d’Artagnan, and not to M. de Wardes."
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "para": 7,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "He opened it and read as follows:"
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "para": 8,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "DEAR M. D’ARTAGNAN, It is wrong thus to neglect your friends,\nparticularly at the moment you are about to leave them for so long a\ntime. My brother-in-law and myself expected you yesterday and the day\nbefore, but in vain. Will it be the same this evening?"
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "para": 9,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Your very grateful,\nMILADY CLARIK"
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "para": 10,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“That’s all very simple,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 12,
   "para": 10,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said D’Artagnan;"
  },
  {
   "n": 13,
   "para": 10,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I expected this letter. My\ncredit rises by the fall of that of the Comte de Wardes.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 14,
   "para": 11,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“And will you go?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 15,
   "para": 11,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "asked Kitty."
  },
  {
   "n": 16,
   "para": 12,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Listen to me, my dear girl,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 17,
   "para": 12,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said the Gascon, who sought for an excuse\nin his own eyes for breaking the promise he had made Athos;"
  },
  {
   "n": 18,
   "para": 12,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“you must\nunderstand it would be impolitic not to accept such a positive\ninvitation. Milady, not seeing me come again, would not be able to\nunderstand what could cause the interruption of my visits, and might\nsuspect something; who could say how far the vengeance of such a woman\nwould go?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 19,
   "para": 13,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Oh, my God!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 20,
   "para": 13,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Kitty,"
  },
  {
   "n": 21,
   "para": 13,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“you know how to represent things in such a\nway that you are always in the right. You are going now to pay your\ncourt to her again, and if this time you succeed in pleasing her in\nyour own name and with your own face, it will be much worse than\nbefore.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 22,
   "para": 14,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Instinct made poor Kitty guess a part of what was to happen. D’Artagnan\nreassured her as well as he could, and promised to remain insensible to\nthe seductions of Milady."
  },
  {
   "n": 23,
   "para": 15,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "He desired Kitty to tell her mistress that he could not be more\ngrateful for her kindnesses than he was, and that he would be obedient\nto her orders. He did not dare to write for fear of not being able—to\nsuch experienced eyes as those of Milady—to disguise his writing\nsufficiently."
  },
  {
   "n": 24,
   "para": 16,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "As nine o’clock sounded, D’Artagnan was at the Place Royale. It was\nevident that the servants who waited in the antechamber were warned,\nfor as soon as D’Artagnan appeared, before even he had asked if Milady\nwere visible, one of them ran to announce him."
  },
  {
   "n": 25,
   "para": 17,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Show him in,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 26,
   "para": 17,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Milady, in a quick tone, but so piercing that\nD’Artagnan heard her in the antechamber."
  },
  {
   "n": 27,
   "para": 18,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "He was introduced."
  },
  {
   "n": 28,
   "para": 19,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“I am at home to nobody,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 29,
   "para": 19,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Milady;"
  },
  {
   "n": 30,
   "para": 19,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“observe, to _nobody_.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 31,
   "para": 20,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "The servant went out."
  },
  {
   "n": 32,
   "para": 21,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "D’Artagnan cast an inquiring glance at Milady. She was pale, and looked\nfatigued, either from tears or want of sleep. The number of lights had\nbeen intentionally diminished, but the young woman could not conceal\nthe traces of the fever which had devoured her for two days."
  },
  {
   "n": 33,
   "para": 22,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "D’Artagnan approached her with his usual gallantry. She then made an\nextraordinary effort to receive him, but never did a more distressed\ncountenance give the lie to a more amiable smile."
  },
  {
   "n": 34,
   "para": 23,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "To the questions which D’Artagnan put concerning her health, she\nreplied,"
  },
  {
   "n": 35,
   "para": 23,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Bad, very bad.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 36,
   "para": 24,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Then,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 37,
   "para": 24,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "replied he,"
  },
  {
   "n": 38,
   "para": 24,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“my visit is ill-timed; you, no doubt, stand in\nneed of repose, and I will withdraw.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 39,
   "para": 25,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“No, no!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 40,
   "para": 25,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Milady."
  },
  {
   "n": 41,
   "para": 25,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“On the contrary, stay, Monsieur d’Artagnan;\nyour agreeable company will divert me.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 42,
   "para": 26,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Oh, oh!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 43,
   "para": 26,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "thought D’Artagnan."
  },
  {
   "n": 44,
   "para": 26,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“She has never been so kind before. On\nguard!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 45,
   "para": 27,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Milady assumed the most agreeable air possible, and conversed with more\nthan her usual brilliancy. At the same time the fever, which for an\ninstant abandoned her, returned to give luster to her eyes, color to\nher cheeks, and vermillion to her lips. D’Artagnan was again in the\npresence of the Circe who had before surrounded him with her\nenchantments. His love, which he believed to be extinct but which was\nonly asleep, awoke again in his heart. Milady smiled, and D’Artagnan\nfelt that he could damn himself for that smile. There was a moment at\nwhich he felt something like remorse."
  },
  {
   "n": 46,
   "para": 28,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "By degrees, Milady became more communicative. She asked D’Artagnan if\nhe had a mistress."
  },
  {
   "n": 47,
   "para": 29,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Alas!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 48,
   "para": 29,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said D’Artagnan, with the most sentimental air he could assume,"
  },
  {
   "n": 49,
   "para": 29,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“can you be cruel enough to put such a question to me—to me, who, from\nthe moment I saw you, have only breathed and sighed through you and for\nyou?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 50,
   "para": 30,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Milady smiled with a strange smile."
  },
  {
   "n": 51,
   "para": 31,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Then you love me?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 52,
   "para": 31,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said she."
  },
  {
   "n": 53,
   "para": 32,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Have I any need to tell you so? Have you not perceived it?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 54,
   "para": 33,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“It may be; but you know the more hearts are worth the capture, the\nmore difficult they are to be won.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 55,
   "para": 34,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Oh, difficulties do not affright me,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 56,
   "para": 34,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said D’Artagnan."
  },
  {
   "n": 57,
   "para": 34,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I shrink\nbefore nothing but impossibilities.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 58,
   "para": 35,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Nothing is impossible,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 59,
   "para": 35,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "replied Milady,"
  },
  {
   "n": 60,
   "para": 35,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“to true love.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 61,
   "para": 36,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Nothing, madame?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 62,
   "para": 37,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Nothing,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 63,
   "para": 37,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "replied Milady."
  },
  {
   "n": 64,
   "para": 38,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“The devil!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 65,
   "para": 38,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "thought D’Artagnan."
  },
  {
   "n": 66,
   "para": 38,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“The note is changed. Is she going to\nfall in love with me, by chance, this fair inconstant; and will she be\ndisposed to give me myself another sapphire like that which she gave me\nfor De Wardes?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 67,
   "para": 39,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "D’Artagnan rapidly drew his seat nearer to Milady’s."
  },
  {
   "n": 68,
   "para": 40,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Well, now,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 69,
   "para": 40,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "she said,"
  },
  {
   "n": 70,
   "para": 40,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“let us see what you would do to prove this love\nof which you speak.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 71,
   "para": 41,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“All that could be required of me. Order; I am ready.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 72,
   "para": 42,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“For everything?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 73,
   "para": 43,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“For everything,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 74,
   "para": 43,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried D’Artagnan, who knew beforehand that he had not\nmuch to risk in engaging himself thus."
  },
  {
   "n": 75,
   "para": 44,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Well, now let us talk a little seriously,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 76,
   "para": 44,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Milady, in her turn\ndrawing her armchair nearer to D’Artagnan’s chair."
  },
  {
   "n": 77,
   "para": 45,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I am all attention, madame,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 78,
   "para": 45,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said he."
  },
  {
   "n": 79,
   "para": 46,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Milady remained thoughtful and undecided for a moment; then, as if\nappearing to have formed a resolution, she said,"
  },
  {
   "n": 80,
   "para": 46,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“I have an enemy.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 81,
   "para": 47,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“You, madame!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 82,
   "para": 47,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said D’Artagnan, affecting surprise;"
  },
  {
   "n": 83,
   "para": 47,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“is that possible,\nmy God?—good and beautiful as you are!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 84,
   "para": 48,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“A mortal enemy.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 85,
   "para": 49,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Indeed!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 86,
   "para": 50,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“An enemy who has insulted me so cruelly that between him and me it is\nwar to the death. May I reckon on you as an auxiliary?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 87,
   "para": 51,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "D’Artagnan at once perceived the ground which the vindictive creature\nwished to reach."
  },
  {
   "n": 88,
   "para": 52,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“You may, madame,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 89,
   "para": 52,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said he, with emphasis."
  },
  {
   "n": 90,
   "para": 52,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“My arm and my life belong\nto you, like my love.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 91,
   "para": 53,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Then,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 92,
   "para": 53,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Milady,"
  },
  {
   "n": 93,
   "para": 53,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“since you are as generous as you are loving—”"
  },
  {
   "n": 94,
   "para": 54,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "She stopped."
  },
  {
   "n": 95,
   "para": 55,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Well?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 96,
   "para": 55,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "demanded D’Artagnan."
  },
  {
   "n": 97,
   "para": 56,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Well,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 98,
   "para": 56,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "replied Milady, after a moment of silence,"
  },
  {
   "n": 99,
   "para": 56,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“from the present\ntime, cease to talk of impossibilities.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 100,
   "para": 57,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Do not overwhelm me with happiness,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 101,
   "para": 57,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried D’Artagnan, throwing\nhimself on his knees, and covering with kisses the hands abandoned to\nhim."
  },
  {
   "n": 102,
   "para": 58,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Avenge me of that infamous De Wardes,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 103,
   "para": 58,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Milady, between her teeth,"
  },
  {
   "n": 104,
   "para": 58,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“and I shall soon know how to get rid of you—you double idiot, you\nanimated sword blade!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 105,
   "para": 59,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Fall voluntarily into my arms, hypocritical and dangerous woman,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 106,
   "para": 59,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said\nD’Artagnan, likewise to himself,"
  },
  {
   "n": 107,
   "para": 59,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“after having abused me with such\neffrontery, and afterward I will laugh at you with him whom you wish me\nto kill.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 108,
   "para": 60,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "D’Artagnan lifted up his head."
  },
  {
   "n": 109,
   "para": 61,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I am ready,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 110,
   "para": 61,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said he."
  },
  {
   "n": 111,
   "para": 62,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“You have understood me, then, dear Monsieur d’Artagnan,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 112,
   "para": 62,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Milady."
  },
  {
   "n": 113,
   "para": 63,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I could interpret one of your looks.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 114,
   "para": 64,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Then you would employ for me your arm which has already acquired so\nmuch renown?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 115,
   "para": 65,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Instantly!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 116,
   "para": 66,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“But on my part,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 117,
   "para": 66,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Milady,"
  },
  {
   "n": 118,
   "para": 66,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“how should I repay such a service? I\nknow these lovers. They are men who do nothing for nothing.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 119,
   "para": 67,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“You know the only reply that I desire,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 120,
   "para": 67,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said D’Artagnan,"
  },
  {
   "n": 121,
   "para": 67,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“the only one\nworthy of you and of me!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 122,
   "para": 68,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "And he drew nearer to her."
  },
  {
   "n": 123,
   "para": 69,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "She scarcely resisted."
  },
  {
   "n": 124,
   "para": 70,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Interested man!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 125,
   "para": 70,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried she, smiling.",
   "audio": "https://ianingram.github.io/Amenti-Readings/the-three-musketeers/sound/tm-ch36-cue125-v1.mp3"
  },
  {
   "n": 126,
   "para": 71,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Ah,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 127,
   "para": 71,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried D’Artagnan, really carried away by the passion this woman\nhad the power to kindle in his heart,"
  },
  {
   "n": 128,
   "para": 71,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“ah, that is because my happiness\nappears so impossible to me; and I have such fear that it should fly\naway from me like a dream that I pant to make a reality of it.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 129,
   "para": 72,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Well, merit this pretended happiness, then!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 130,
   "para": 73,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I am at your orders,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 131,
   "para": 73,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said D’Artagnan."
  },
  {
   "n": 132,
   "para": 74,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Quite certain?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 133,
   "para": 74,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Milady, with a last doubt."
  },
  {
   "n": 134,
   "para": 75,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Only name to me the base man that has brought tears into your\nbeautiful eyes!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 135,
   "para": 76,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Who told you that I had been weeping?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 136,
   "para": 76,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said she."
  },
  {
   "n": 137,
   "para": 77,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“It appeared to me—”"
  },
  {
   "n": 138,
   "para": 78,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Such women as I never weep,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 139,
   "para": 78,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Milady."
  },
  {
   "n": 140,
   "para": 79,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“So much the better! Come, tell me his name!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 141,
   "para": 80,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Remember that his name is all my secret.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 142,
   "para": 81,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Yet I must know his name.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 143,
   "para": 82,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Yes, you must; see what confidence I have in you!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 144,
   "para": 83,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“You overwhelm me with joy. What is his name?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 145,
   "para": 84,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“You know him.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 146,
   "para": 85,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Indeed.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 147,
   "para": 86,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Yes.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 148,
   "para": 87,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“It is surely not one of my friends?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 149,
   "para": 87,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "replied D’Artagnan, affecting\nhesitation in order to make her believe him ignorant."
  },
  {
   "n": 150,
   "para": 88,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“If it were one of your friends you would hesitate, then?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 151,
   "para": 88,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried\nMilady; and a threatening glance darted from her eyes."
  },
  {
   "n": 152,
   "para": 89,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Not if it were my own brother!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 153,
   "para": 89,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried D’Artagnan, as if carried away\nby his enthusiasm."
  },
  {
   "n": 154,
   "para": 90,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Our Gascon promised this without risk, for he knew all that was meant."
  },
  {
   "n": 155,
   "para": 91,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“I love your devotedness,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 156,
   "para": 91,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Milady."
  },
  {
   "n": 157,
   "para": 92,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Alas, do you love nothing else in me?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 158,
   "para": 92,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "asked D’Artagnan."
  },
  {
   "n": 159,
   "para": 93,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“I love you also, _you!_”"
  },
  {
   "n": 160,
   "para": 93,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said she, taking his hand."
  },
  {
   "n": 161,
   "para": 94,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "The warm pressure made D’Artagnan tremble, as if by the touch that\nfever which consumed Milady attacked himself."
  },
  {
   "n": 162,
   "para": 95,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“You love me, you!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 163,
   "para": 95,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried he."
  },
  {
   "n": 164,
   "para": 95,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Oh, if that were so, I should lose my\nreason!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 165,
   "para": 96,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "And he folded her in his arms. She made no effort to remove her lips\nfrom his kisses; only she did not respond to them. Her lips were cold;\nit appeared to D’Artagnan that he had embraced a statue."
  },
  {
   "n": 166,
   "para": 97,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "He was not the less intoxicated with joy, electrified by love. He\nalmost believed in the tenderness of Milady; he almost believed in the\ncrime of De Wardes. If De Wardes had at that moment been under his\nhand, he would have killed him."
  },
  {
   "n": 167,
   "para": 98,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Milady seized the occasion."
  },
  {
   "n": 168,
   "para": 99,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“His name is—”"
  },
  {
   "n": 169,
   "para": 99,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said she, in her turn."
  },
  {
   "n": 170,
   "para": 100,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“De Wardes; I know it,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 171,
   "para": 100,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried D’Artagnan."
  },
  {
   "n": 172,
   "para": 101,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“And how do you know it?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 173,
   "para": 101,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "asked Milady, seizing both his hands, and\nendeavoring to read with her eyes to the bottom of his heart."
  },
  {
   "n": 174,
   "para": 102,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "D’Artagnan felt he had allowed himself to be carried away, and that he\nhad committed an error."
  },
  {
   "n": 175,
   "para": 103,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Tell me, tell me, tell me, I say,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 176,
   "para": 103,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "repeated Milady,"
  },
  {
   "n": 177,
   "para": 103,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“how do you know\nit?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 178,
   "para": 104,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“How do I know it?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 179,
   "para": 104,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said D’Artagnan."
  },
  {
   "n": 180,
   "para": 105,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Yes.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 181,
   "para": 106,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I know it because yesterday Monsieur de Wardes, in a saloon where I\nwas, showed a ring which he said he had received from you.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 182,
   "para": 107,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Wretch!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 183,
   "para": 107,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried Milady."
  },
  {
   "n": 184,
   "para": 108,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "The epithet, as may be easily understood, resounded to the very bottom\nof D’Artagnan’s heart."
  },
  {
   "n": 185,
   "para": 109,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Well?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 186,
   "para": 109,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "continued she."
  },
  {
   "n": 187,
   "para": 110,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Well, I will avenge you of this wretch,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 188,
   "para": 110,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "replied D’Artagnan, giving\nhimself the airs of Don Japhet of Armenia."
  },
  {
   "n": 189,
   "para": 111,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Thanks, my brave friend!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 190,
   "para": 111,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried Milady;"
  },
  {
   "n": 191,
   "para": 111,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“and when shall I be avenged?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 192,
   "para": 112,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Tomorrow—immediately—when you please!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 193,
   "para": 113,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Milady was about to cry out,"
  },
  {
   "n": 194,
   "para": 113,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Immediately,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 195,
   "para": 113,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "but she reflected that such\nprecipitation would not be very gracious toward D’Artagnan."
  },
  {
   "n": 196,
   "para": 114,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Besides, she had a thousand precautions to take, a thousand counsels to\ngive to her defender, in order that he might avoid explanations with\nthe count before witnesses. All this was answered by an expression of\nD’Artagnan’s."
  },
  {
   "n": 197,
   "para": 114,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Tomorrow,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 198,
   "para": 114,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said he,"
  },
  {
   "n": 199,
   "para": 114,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“you will be avenged, or I shall be\ndead.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 200,
   "para": 115,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“No,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 201,
   "para": 115,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said she,"
  },
  {
   "n": 202,
   "para": 115,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“you will avenge me; but you will not be dead. He is a\ncoward.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 203,
   "para": 116,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“With women, perhaps; but not with men. I know something of him.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 204,
   "para": 117,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“But it seems you had not much reason to complain of your fortune in\nyour contest with him.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 205,
   "para": 118,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Fortune is a courtesan; favorable yesterday, she may turn her back\ntomorrow.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 206,
   "para": 119,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Which means that you now hesitate?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 207,
   "para": 120,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“No, I do not hesitate; God forbid! But would it be just to allow me to\ngo to a possible death without having given me at least something more\nthan hope?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 208,
   "para": 121,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Milady answered by a glance which said,"
  },
  {
   "n": 209,
   "para": 121,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Is that all?—speak, then.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 210,
   "para": 121,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "And\nthen accompanying the glance with explanatory words,"
  },
  {
   "n": 211,
   "para": 121,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“That is but too\njust,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 212,
   "para": 121,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said she, tenderly."
  },
  {
   "n": 213,
   "para": 122,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Oh, you are an angel!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 214,
   "para": 122,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "exclaimed the young man."
  },
  {
   "n": 215,
   "para": 123,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Then all is agreed?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 216,
   "para": 123,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said she."
  },
  {
   "n": 217,
   "para": 124,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Except that which I ask of you, dear love.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 218,
   "para": 125,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“But when I assure you that you may rely on my tenderness?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 219,
   "para": 126,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I cannot wait till tomorrow.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 220,
   "para": 127,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Silence! I hear my brother. It will be useless for him to find you\nhere.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 221,
   "para": 128,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "She rang the bell and Kitty appeared."
  },
  {
   "n": 222,
   "para": 129,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“Go out this way,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 223,
   "para": 129,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said she, opening a small private door,"
  },
  {
   "n": 224,
   "para": 129,
   "role": "Milady de Winter",
   "cast": "Sarah Bernhardt",
   "text": "“and come\nback at eleven o’clock; we will then terminate this conversation. Kitty\nwill conduct you to my chamber.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 225,
   "para": 130,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "The poor girl almost fainted at hearing these words."
  },
  {
   "n": 226,
   "para": 131,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
